{"title":"Fix Deployment selector immutable field","body":"Root cause: The Deployment selector uses a different label (vigil-app-typo) than the pod template labels, causing an immutable field error.

Evidence:
Deployment.apps "vigil-app" is invalid: [spec.template.metadata.labels: Invalid value: {"app":"vigil-app"}: `selector` does not match template `labels`, spec.selector: Invalid value: {"matchLabels":{"app":"vigil-app-typo"}}: field is immutable]","auto_merge":true}
